window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>With her heart literally in his hands, Celia will have to try and bargain with a devil.</p> <p>Edward Fasbender is my captor.</p> <p>Trapped on this island he owns everything on—including, it seems, me.</p> <p>He told me he would break me, but I thought he meant in the bedroom. It turns out Edward is playing a completely different game.</p> <p>And he won't stop until he's ruined me.</p>"; 
